  "uprn": "100021542356",
  "decision_date": "15/04/2003",
  "description": "Erection of single storey rear and side extension to provide an additional one bedroom flat on the ground floor, installation of side windows to exisitng ground floor flat, creation of 3 parking bays in the rear garden, with access off Clipstone Road, and erection of a new 1.5m high fence on the boundary with Clipstone Road",
  "site_name": "63",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "10/12/2002",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW3 3AW",
  "street_name": "Bulstrode Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major all other major developments",
  "lapsed_date": "13/04/2008",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before theflat is occupied.",
    "Condition : 4 - The use hereby permitted as a flat shall not be begun until full particulars and details of a scheme to insulate the premises against the transmission of airborne and impact sound has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and the development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given.",
    "Condition : 5 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in theeast and west walls of the new flat hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 6 - The car parking spaces shown on drawing No. 588-P-03 received 25.3.03 shall be provided before the flat hereby approved is first occupied and thereafter it shall not be used for any purpose other than the parking of vehicles for the 3 flats at 63 Bulstrode Road."
  ],
